  "text": " complicated deal with, but with a systematic approach, we can understand the following:\n\n由于我们可以绕线解决残留问题，\n我们便可以order their\n我们可以变成 a infinite sum:\n\\[\\frac{1}{\\prod_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\left(1 + \\frac{1}{x_n}\\right)} = \\prod_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\left(1 + \\frac{1}{x_n}\\right)\\]\nNow let us consider the infinite series $\\textbf{无穷级数}$ in $\\frac{1}{\\prod_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\left(1 + \\frac{1}{x_n}\\right)}$, we shall find a closed form expression of the series at first.\nWe have that\n\\[ 4^2 \\cdot 4^2 \\cdot 4^2 \\cdot ... = \\frac{4}{1 - (4^2)^{-1}} = 1\n\\]\nTherefore, for $n \\geq 1$, we have $\\frac{1}{x_n} = 4$, which implies that\n\\[\\frac{1}{\\prod_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\left(1 + \\frac{1}{x_n}\\right)} = \\frac{1}{1} = 1.\\]\nSo the value of the infinite product is $\\boxed{1}$.",
